# Save: At stop (0.17.82, the Settings page's second knob). A store while playing is kept (the piece reads as stored) but not written: no fade.
# Stopping writes it. A genre change with it waiting writes it first (faded), and turning again then changes the genre. Anytime is as before.
seed 0
wait 3000
expect playing 1
# the settings walk: HOLD HOME opens it; SELECT 2 is the Settings page; its second knob, Save: At stop
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 200
turn SELECT 2
wait 100
spin K2 1
wait 300
shot savestop_settings.png
tap FX
wait 300
# piece 01 stored while playing: kept, no fade
tap GLO
wait 200
turn K1 10
wait 200
press SAVE
wait 200
release SAVE
wait 400
expect storewait 0
expect hushed 0
expect saved 1
expect dirty 1
expect playing 1
# a genre change: the waiting store goes first (faded), the genre stays this turn
press GLO
wait 100
turn PRESET 1
wait 200
release GLO
wait 600
expect genre 0
expect dirty 0
press GLO
wait 100
turn PRESET 1
wait 200
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 1
# back, store again, then stop: written at the stop
press GLO
turn PRESET -1
release GLO
wait 300
expect genre 0
turn K1 -10
wait 200
shot savestop_2.png
wait 200
press SAVE
wait 200
release SAVE
wait 400
expect hushed 0
expect dirty 1
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect playing 0
expect dirty 0
expect saved 1
